# Single-page application fallback.
#
# /projects/:slug and /admin are client-side routes with no matching file on
# disk. Without this rule a visitor who opens or refreshes a project URL, or
# follows a shared link, gets the host's 404 instead of the app.
#
# Status 200 (not 301) so the URL is preserved and search engines index the
# project page rather than a redirect.
/*    /index.html   200
